{{- /*
io.silverbeer.cycle-runner.plist — launchd agent for cycle-runner (SB-930).

Mac mini only: `.chezmoi.hostname` is the SHORT hostname (no domain — measured
`chezmoi data` on this machine returns "Mac" for a `Mac.fios-router.home` box,
confirming the field, not `.chezmoi.fqdnHostname`, is the right gate). The
whole file, including the XML declaration, sits inside the `if` — chezmoi
treats a template that renders to the empty string as "no target": measured
against a scratch source/dest pair with `chezmoi apply` (both --dry-run and a
real apply), a template that renders empty creates nothing at all, not an
empty file. So on every Mac that is not the mini, this path simply does not
exist after `chezmoi apply` — no `.chezmoiignore` exception needed for that.

`StartInterval` 1800s (30 min), matching run.sh's own "the lock makes a
concurrent tick a no-op, never queue two". `RunAtLoad` false: the mini's login
should not immediately fire a cycle before a human has had a chance to look at
the box.

launchd does not source ~/.zshrc or ~/.zprofile, so PATH here is the explicit
list run.sh's own toolchain needs (op, gh, claude, jq, git, python3): Homebrew
on Apple Silicon, then the user's ~/.local/bin (where `claude` itself lives on
the machine this was built on — ASSUMPTION: the mini's `claude` binary sits in
the same place; doctor.sh's binary check is what catches it if not).
*/ -}}
{{- if eq .chezmoi.hostname "Toms-Mac-mini" -}}
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>Label</key>
	<string>io.silverbeer.cycle-runner</string>

	<key>ProgramArguments</key>
	<array>
		<string>/bin/bash</string>
		<string>{{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/.claude/skills/cycle-runner/scripts/run.sh</string>
	</array>

	<key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
	<dict>
		<key>HOME</key>
		<string>{{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}</string>
		<key>PATH</key>
		<string>{{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/.local/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/opt/homebrew/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
	</dict>

	<key>StartInterval</key>
	<integer>1800</integer>

	<key>RunAtLoad</key>
	<false/>

	<key>StandardOutPath</key>
	<string>{{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/.local/state/cycle-runner/launchd.out.log</string>

	<key>StandardErrorPath</key>
	<string>{{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/.local/state/cycle-runner/launchd.err.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
{{- end -}}
